@startuml 02-kmp-mvi-and-clientui-class-diagram
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans SC"
skinparam shadowing false
title KMP MVI 与共享UI类关系

class MviStateOwner {
state: StateFlow<State>
effects: Flow<Effect>
accept(intent)
close()
}
class MviStore {
reduce(reducer)
setState(next)
sendEffect(effect)
close()
}
class MobileStore {
主壳与会话
共享业务状态与导航
}
class MobileFeatureStore {
48个FeaturePage
组合专业Store
}
class SensitiveActionStore {
scope与用途认证
原请求与未知结果恢复
}
class ProviderAuthStore {
登录 / 绑定 / 冲突
}
class AgeAssuranceStore {
年龄会话与查询
}
class GuardianInviteStore {
邀请 / 撤销 / 领取
}
class ConsumerApp {
共享Compose页面
窗口自适应
}
class ClientUiPlatform {
系统能力端口
Android / iOS / Desktop
}
MviStore --> MviStateOwner : 实现
MobileStore --> MviStore : 继承
MobileFeatureStore --> MviStore : 继承
SensitiveActionStore --> MviStore : 继承
ProviderAuthStore --> MviStore : 继承
AgeAssuranceStore --> MviStore : 继承
GuardianInviteStore --> MviStore : 继承
MobileFeatureStore --> SensitiveActionStore : 组合
MobileFeatureStore --> ProviderAuthStore : 组合
MobileFeatureStore --> AgeAssuranceStore : 组合
MobileFeatureStore --> GuardianInviteStore : 组合
ConsumerApp --> MobileStore : 读取
ConsumerApp --> MobileFeatureStore : 读取
ConsumerApp --> ClientUiPlatform : 平台能力
@enduml
